<title>UK: Commerzbank unit sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, Credit Europeen, Banque Bruxelles Lambert and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK INTERNATIONAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    18.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.30    PAY DATE  S-18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 4.54 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   PRAECIPIUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
